<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Ian Drosos - HCI+AI Researcher/Designer/Developer</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Ian Drosos - HCI+AI Researcher/Designer/Developer. Mixed-methods HCI researcher designing tools for developers, data scientists, and learners. Currently leading UX at Trent AI."
    />

