                      width: 14px;
                      height: 14px;
                      margin-right: var(--space-2);
                      display: inline-block;
                      vertical-align: middle;
                    "
                  ></i>
                  2024: 2nd place 'Everyday AI' Executive Challenge by Peter Lee
